    <string name="ussd_settings_description">Hafi bibiri bya gatatu by\'abantu mu Rwanda bafite telefoni idasanzwe (feature phone), atari smartphone. Shyiraho PIN nyayo ya USSD ifite imibare 4-6 kugira ngo urebe amafaranga ufite kandi wohereze amafaranga uva kuri telefoni iyo ari yo yose, nta porogaramu cyangwa interineti bikenewe.</string>
    <string name="ussd_settings_honest_scope">Byagenwe neza: menu nyayo, kugenzura PIN, no kohereza amafaranga byuzuye kandi birakora none. Guhamagara ikoodi ngufi nka *123# kugira ngo ubigereho bisaba ubufatanye nyabwo n\'uwatanga serivisi za terefone (MNO) uyu mushinga utaragira -- ni imbogamizi imwe n\'iyo dufite ku kwemeza indangamuntu.</string>
